    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No. 80 Bunbury Gate Crescent is a most impressive three bedroom home, presented in excellent condition throughout. The property has been lovingly maintained and cared for. Ideally located, this property overlooks open green space to the front. There is a front garden, driveway and pedestrian side entrance leading to the sunny South facing private rear garden. The bright and spacious accommodation extends to approx. 99 sq.m. and comprises entrance hall, guest wc, living room, open plan kitchen/dining room with utility off. Upstairs there are three bedrooms, main bedroom en suite and main bathroom. Bunbury Gate is conveniently located within walking distance to all local amenities including a host of primary and secondary schools, shops, church and the Swords Express and Dublin bus routes. Easy access is enjoyed to Swords Main Street, Airside Retail Park, Dublin Airport, M1 and M50 motorways. Viewing is highly recommended to appreciate the quality of accommodation on offer.\r\n\r\n* Excellent condition throughout\r\n* Private, Sunny South facing rear garden\r\n* Overlooking large open green space to the front\r\n* Quiet cul de sac location\r\n* Utility room\r\n* Main bedroom with en suite\r\n* Lovingly maintained\r\n* Double glazed windows throughout\r\n* Gas fired central heating\r\n* Adjacent to parklands including Broadmeadow Community Garden & Children’s playground\r\n* Walking distance to all local amenities including a host of schools, shops, church, playgrounds, The Ward Rivervalley Park and Swords Main Street\r\n* Bus routes within walking distance include:\r\nSwords Express – Express service to Dublin City Centre\r\nDublin Bus Routes 41 and 41C\r\n* Primary Schools close by:\r\nSt. Cronan’s Junior National School\r\nSwords Educate Together National School\r\nThornleigh Educate Together National School\r\nGaelscoil Brian Boroimhe\r\nBroadmeadow CNS\r\n* Secondary Schools:\r\nSwords Community College, St Finian’s Community College, Fingal Community College, Loreto College, Colaiste Choilm"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground Floor\r\n\r\nEntrance hall   -   Laminate floor. Composite front door. Guest wc off. Stairs to first floor.\r\n\r\nGuest wc   -   1.6m x 0.8m\r\nTiled floor. Window. Toilet and sink.\r\n\t\t\r\nLiving room   -   4.9m x 3.4m (5.6 into Bay window)\r\nSpacious living room with bay window. Laminate floor. Feature fireplace with gas insert. Double doors to kitchen/dining room.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining room   -   5.8m x 5.4m\r\nFitted shaker style kitchen units with breakfast counter. Tiled floor Laminate floor to dining area. Sliding door to the private rear garden.\r\n\t\t\r\nUtility room   -   1.2m x 1.5m\r\nVinyl floor. Plumbed for washer/dryer.\r\n                                     \r\nFirst Floor\r\n\r\nLanding   -   Carpet fitted. Hotpress. Access hatch to attic.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1   -   4.5m x 3.2m (rear)\r\nSpacious double bedroom with carpet fitted. Built in wardrobes and en suite off.\r\n\r\nEn suite   -   1.5m x 2.1m\r\nFully tiled. Shower, toilet and sink. Window.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2   -   4.5m x 3.0m (front left)\r\nDouble room with built in wardrobes. Carpet fitted. Bay window.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3   -   2.6m x 2.3m (front right)\t\t\r\nSingle room with carpet fitted.\r\n\r\nBathroom   -   1.7m x 2.1m\r\nFully tiled. Bath with electric shower fitted, toilet and sink.\r\n\r\nOUTSIDE:\r\nFront garden, driveway with lawn. Overlooking open green space to the front. Pedestrian side entrance leads to the sunny South facing rear garden with lawn and mature planting."
      },
